    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideally situated on the outskirts of Ennis Town, this spacious four-bedroom detached residence offers an excellent opportunity for families and those seeking a home with generous living space in a highly convenient location. Ennis is a thriving economic centre with an extensive range of amenities, including schools, shops, restaurants, healthcare facilities, sporting clubs, and excellent transport links, making it an ideal place to call home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to a welcoming entrance hall, a bright kitchen/dining area, utility room, comfortable living room, four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite, and a main family bathroom.\r\n\r\nWhile the property would benefit from some light refurbishment and cosmetic updating, it is presented in generally good condition throughout, allowing purchasers to add their own style and value over time.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property occupies a generous site with ample outdoor space and features a substantial detached garage offering exceptional versatility. Subject to the necessary planning permission, this building presents excellent potential for a workshop, home office, gym, studio, or self-contained accommodation.\r\n\r\nCombining spacious accommodation, a large site, and outstanding potential, this property represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a detached family home in a sought-after location close to all the amenities of Ennis Town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tShort distance from motorway that links to Shannon, Limerick and Galway.\r\n•\tIdeal location on the outskirts of town\r\n•\tSpacious four – bed family home with ground floor bedroom.\r\n•\tLarge site with generous garage that has potential for multiple uses.\r\n•\tBER C 189.07 kWh/m²/yr. No: 105153118"
      },
      {
